      410.17,
      539.95,
      469.24
    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby informed, according to sub section (2) of the Entertainment Tax Ordinance Chapter 267, that the followingproposal which is decided by the Secretary of the Pujapitiya Pradeshiya Sabha (Divisional Council of Pujapitiya), in termsof the provisions of Section 2(1) of the above Ordinance, has been accepted by the Minister in-charge for the subject oflocal governments of the provincial council of the central province, in terms of the provisions of sub section (2) of thesaid ordinance.",
