      614.17,
      539.97,
      661.24
    ],
    "text": "I have decided to levy an Entertaiment Tax of 10% from the ticket fares (except the entertainment tax) within thelimits of the Pujapitiya Pradeshiya Sabha (Divisional Council of Pujapitiya), in terms of the powers vested to me accordingto Section 9(3) of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of 1987 and in terms of provisions of Section 2(1) of the EntertainmentTax Ordinance No. 12 of 1946 further amended by the Entertainment Tax Act, No. 37 of 1984.",
